  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Davidi wakamba ne, Eu udi nsubu wa Yehowa Nzambi, etshi ntshioshelu tshia Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakela mukenji wandi bua kusangishabo bantu bakadi bashikama mu buloba bua Isalele diambedi; wakasungula bahandi ba mabue bua kusongabo mabue a kuibaka nʼau ntempelo wa Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakalongolola biamu bifike bia bungi bua kufulabo nʼabi misamadi ya kuenzabo nʼai bibi ne mabaya makuabo; wakasangisha biamu bia mitaku biakadibo kabayi bamanye mua kubala bujitu buabi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne mitshi ya cèdre yakadi bungi buakadibo kabayi bamanye; bualu bua Bena Sidona ne Bena Tulo bakalua kudi Davidi ne mitshi ya cèdre ya bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakamba ne, Muanʼanyi Solomo utshidi nsongalume udi mutekete, ne nsubu utudi tuibakila Yehowa udi ne bua kuikala muakane ne wa butumbi ku nseke yonso ya buloba; nunku meme nembange kusangisha bintu. Nunku Davidi wakasangisha bintu bia bungi diambedi yeye kayi muanze kufua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakabikila Solomo muanʼandi, wakamuelela mukenji bua kuibakileye Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakambila Solomo muanʼandi ne. Bualu buakadi mu mutshima wanyi bua kuibaka nsubu mu dina dia Yehowa Nzambi wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, Wewe wakamatshisha mashi a bungi hanshi, wakaluangana nvita ya bungi; wewe kuena ungibakila nsubu bua meme kutekamu dina dianyi nansha, bualu bua wewe wakamatshisha mashi a bungi hanshi ha buloba ku mesu kuanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi mona, wewe neulele muana wa balume, neikale muena ditalala; nemmuhe ditalala kudi bena lukuna bonso badi bamunyunguluke; bualu bua dina diandi nedikale Solomo; nenvuishe ditalala ne dikisha mu buloba bua Isalele mu matuku andi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye neibakile dina dianyi nsubu; yeye neikale muanʼanyi, meme nengikale tatu wandi; nenjadike nkuasa wa bukelenge buandi mu Isalele tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka, muanʼanyi, Yehowa ikale nʼebe; wikale ne diakalengele, wibakile Yehowa, Nzambi webe, nsubu bu muakuambeye bualu buebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yehowa akuhe lungenyi ne meji a kujingulula nʼau malu, akuteke ku mutu kua Bena Isalele; bua wewe kutumikila mikenji ya Yehowa, Nzambi webe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe wewe newikale ne diakalengele biwadimuka bua kutumikila mikenji ne mei biakambila Yehowa Mose bua Bena Isalele; wikale ne dikima ne mutshima mukole; kutshinyi, kukuatshiki buowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mona, mu kuhuekela kuanyi nakamana kulongoluela nsubu wa Yehowa binunu lukama lua ntalanta",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22.14:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tangila 1 Kulondolola 19.6; 20.2.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya or ne binunu tshinunu bia ntalanta ya argent ne biamu bia mitaku ne biamu bifike bidibo kabayi bamanye mua kubala, bualu bua bidi bia bungi; nakalongolola mabaya ne mabue kabidi; wewe udi mumanye mua kusangishila bintu ha mutu habi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bukuabo kabidi, bena mudimu ba bungi badi nʼebe, bahandi ba mabue ne ba mabaya ne bantu bonso badi ne meji a kuenza midimu yonso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ya or ne ya argent ne ya tshiamu tshia mitaku ne ya tshiamu tshifike, bidi kabiyi mua kubadibua. Juka, ubange mudimu eu; Yehowa ikale nʼebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakelela baminyampala bonso ba mu Isalele mukenji bua kukuatshishabo Solomo muanʼandi, wamba ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa Nzambi wenu kena nʼenu, anyi? Yeye kakanuha ditalala mu nseke yonso, anyi? Bualu bua yeye wakafila bena buloba ebu mu bianza bienu; bena buloba bakateketa ku mpala kua Yehowa ne ku mpala kua bantu bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nutokeshe mitshima yenu ne mioyo yenu bua kukeba Yehowa, Nzambi wenu; jukai, nuashile Yehowa Nzambi muaba wandi wa tshijila, bua nuenu nulue ne mushete wa tshihungidi tshia mei a Yehowa ne bintu bia tshijila bia Nzambi mu nsubu unudi mubaka mu dina dia Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
